EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,




We are reaching out regarding a mutual customer that is returning payments recently after funding. The customers {!Case.Payments_Collected__c} payment has been returned to us on {!Case.Date_of_Bounce__c} due to {!Case.Returned_Payment_Type__c}. Please attempt to reach the customer and have them call into us to get their account resolved. If we are unable to resolve the account we may need to proceed with reclaiming the commission.


Thank you in advance for any help you can provide.





{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
